# 22. Agent Guardrails

The agent must distinguish between:

DATABASE FACTS
→ Student-specific information

DOCUMENT FACTS
→ College policies

CALCULATED INFORMATION
→ Derived using deterministic functions

LLM-GENERATED INFORMATION
→ Explanations and suggestions

Never allow the LLM to invent:

* Attendance
* Marks
* College rules
* Exam dates
* Assignment deadlines
* Timetable entries

